'''Dawnstone Mine''' is a mine shaft that rune beneath [[Gilneas City]] in [[Gilneas]]. It is the only known source in the world of [[Dawnstone Ore]], a valuable and highly magical and energy-resistant<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|43|The Dawnstone Coupler}}</ref> metal that was used to fashion the armor of the paladins of the [[Silver Hand]] during the [[Second War]]. It is believed by some that dawnstone was brought to the surface by a curse of some sort.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|39|Legend of Dawnstone}}</ref> The mine is currently overrun by gnolls of the Foulhide pack.

